  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n({45 div 3 times frac{2)/(3) + 1(1)/(3) of 6(3)/(8) - 4(1)/(8)}}{{(1)/(2)[ {( {2(1)/(4) + 1(1)/(2)} ) div ( {(1)/({15)} + (1)/(3) - (9)/({10)}} )} ]}}\n\n**Concept used:**\n\n** [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/9dc39efa9ed4f0e8f3a13804d9cd35a57480c17ba618ddcb102c34a0474acd66.png] **\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n({45 div 3 times frac{2)/(3) + 1(1)/(3) of 6(3)/(8) - 4(1)/(8)}}{{(1)/(2)[ {( {2(1)/(4) + 1(1)/(2)} ) div ( {(1)/({15)} + (1)/(3) - (9)/({10)}} )} ]}}\n\n⇒ ({45 div 3 times frac{2)/(3) + 1(1)/(3) of 6(3)/(8) - 4(1)/(8)}}{{(1)/(2)[ {( {(9)/(4) + (3)/(2)} ) div ( {(1)/({15)} + (1)/(3) - (9)/({10)}} )} ]}}\n\n⇒ ({45 div 3 times frac{2)/(3) + 1(1)/(3) of 6(3)/(8) - 4(1)/(8)}}{{(1)/(2)[ {( {(9+6)/(4)} ) div ( { (10+2-27)/(30)} )} ]}}\n\n⇒ ({45 div 3 times frac{2)/(3) + (4)/(3) of (51)/(8) - (33)/(8)}}{{(1)/(2)[ {( {(15)/(4)} ) div ( { (-15)/(30)} )} ]}}\n\n⇒ ({45 div 3 times frac{2)/(3) + (4)/(3) of (51)/(8) - (33)/(8)}}{{(1)/(2)[ {( {(15)/(4)} ) times ( { (30)/(-15)} )} ]}}\n\n⇒ ({45 div 3 times frac{2)/(3) + (4)/(3) of (51)/(8) - (33)/(8)}}{{(1)/(2)[ {( {(1)/(2)} ) times ( { (15)/(-1)} )} ]}}\n\n⇒ ({45 div 3 times frac{2)/(3) + (4)/(3) of (51)/(8) - (33)/(8)}}{(15)/(-4)}\n\n⇒ ({45 div 3 times frac{2)/(3) + (17)/(2) - (33)/(8)}}{(15)/(-4)}\n\n⇒ ({15times frac{2)/(3) + (17)/(2) - (33)/(8)}}{(15)/(-4)}\n\n⇒ ({10 + frac{17)/(2) - (33)/(8)}}{(15)/(-4)}\n\n⇒ ({frac{80+68-33)/(8)}}{(15)/(-4)}\n\n⇒ ({frac{115)/(8)}}{(15)/(-4)}\n\n⇒ (115)/(8)times(-4)/(15)\n\n⇒ (23)/(-6)\n\n**∴ Required answer is (23)/(-6)**",
